{"segs": ["PA_ja_242:0.4"], "en": "2. The Sunakhajātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_242:1.1", "PA_ja_242:1.2"], "en": "“Foolish indeed is this dog, who does not bite the leather thong;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_242:1.3", "PA_ja_242:1.4"], "en": "One should release oneself from bonds and, being unattached, depart from the home.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_242:2.1"], "en": "\"I am firm; my mind is steady.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_242:2.2"], "en": "Thus it is engraved upon my heart:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_242:2.3", "PA_ja_242:2.4"], "en": "I await the time until the people have fallen asleep.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
